# Project Integration

## Learn the codebase first

- Find similar features/components and follow those patterns
- Reuse existing libraries and utilities
- Follow existing test patterns

## Tooling

- Use the project's existing build system, test framework, formatter, and linter
- Do not introduce new tools without strong justification

## Code style

- Follow existing conventions in the project
- Honor linter configs and `.editorconfig` when present
- Text files must end with a trailing newline
